  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Homabay Capacity Development project 2016</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CAFOD will support Caritas Homabay through provision of grant to develop a new Strategic Plan and facilitate fundraising training for staff.  The Diocese will engage a consultant who will facilitate a participatory process to involve all stakeholders capturing the realities of the Diocese and to ensure ownership of the documents.  It is expected that this process will not only strengthen the capacity of Caritas Homabay but to improve their relationship with the wider variety of stakeholders including the local government, it will also bring coherence to the different projects ensuring that they are pulling together.  Fundraing training will open funding opportunities and therefore increase outreach to more needy people in the Diocese.</narrative>
  </description>
